could restoring cholesterol transport protect neurons from degeneration?\n\nDCTN1 is a gene linked to Perry syndrome, a rare neurodegenerative disorder. In mouse-brain data, disrupting it increased expression of genes involved in making cholesterol. GPT-Rosalind suggested a possible explanation: cholesterol may not be reaching where neurons need it.\n\nThat gives scientists a specific mechanism to test and, if confirmed, a direction for developing new treatments for neurodegenerative disorders.\n\nWith @perturbai_tx and @scrippsresearch, a team of thousands of GPT-Rosalind agents worked in parallel, connecting gene-expression results from millions of mouse brain cells with scientific literature in just 32 minutes. We’re now expanding this collaboration to identify new drug targets.\n\nhttps://t.co/oHdF3ELsMj"}}},"rest_id":"2112899854569762936","url_entities":[],"views":{"count":"1610392"}}},"rest_id":"2123899406550528422","url_entities":[],"views":{"count":"143790"}}}}}},{"entryId":"tweet-2123862344422088794","sortIndex":"9000000000000000000","content":{"entryType":"TimelineTimelineItem","__typename":"TimelineTimelineItem","itemContent":{"itemType":"TimelineTweet","__typename":"TimelineTweet","tweet_results":{"result":{"__isTweetResult":"Tweet","__typename":"Tweet","card":{"__typename":"Card","id":"Q2FyZDpodHRwczovL3QuY28vRkdRMFBIbGxJTw==","legacy":{"__typename":"LegacyCard","binding_values":[{"key":"photo_image_full_size_large","value":{"image_value":{"alt":"Combatting adversarial distillation, in white text on a lavender and pink abstract background.","height":419,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2123861635983171584/ZI5ZQCaQ?format=jpg&name=800x419","width":800},"type":"IMAGE"}},{"key":"thumbnail_image","value":{"image_value":{"alt":"Combatting adversarial distillation, in white text on a lavender and pink abstract background.","height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/card_img/2123861635983171584/ZI5ZQCaQ?format=jpg&name=280x150","width":267},"type":"IMAGE"}